    confidence 0.87 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source D483A SNOMED CT 95132003 = Swedish subdivision of WHO D48.3 (Neoplasm of uncertain behavior
        of retroperitoneum), specifying pathological-method uncertainty. Target SNOMED CT 4315953 =
        (concept_code 95132003); WHO D48.3 crosswalks here via Athena Maps-to edge. SNOMED CT conflates the
        Swedish A/B uncertainty split into a single concept, so target is broader than source. High
        tier: verified crosswalk, one-level breadth mismatch.
        """
}
